{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "821669e05b43bd9f58797b302c65e1de6c7bdf01196e24d223c32a256783210c", "ja": "（小学校で入学式お祝いライブをすることが決まった。\n星梨花に、ライブの企画書を見てもらったが……）", "zh": "（已经决定要在小学举办入学典礼庆祝演唱会了。\n我让星梨花看了演唱会的策划书，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "337a196628b9decef26473d8f108defd1cc2d891fad7eaa3639864929b608737", "ja": "む～っ……。{$P$}さん。\nこの衣装のことなんですけど。", "zh": "唔～……。{$P$}先生。\n关于这件服装的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "e30fb18fff50419aa374b9ff14fca6ce44bd1a35f6be616996a65dfe566d1d2f", "ja": "これって、小学校の制服ですよね？\nランドセルまでありますし……。", "zh": "这个是小学生的校服吧？\n连双肩书包都有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "b036a8a614d10d061b7ef32574584eaeb2a46b3fc3fdd6b3d99b32432d601d45", "ja": "わたし、そんなに小学生みたいに見えますか？\nたしかに背は高くないですけど……。む～っ……。", "zh": "我看起来真的那么像小学生吗？\n虽然我的个子确实不高……唔～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1004_p", "source_sha256": "23ed1f106f9492e95f5cc43090e28597975fe101a9dab11a8d625ed08812aa5e", "ja": "いや、なんか誤解があるみたいだけど……その制服を\n用意したのには、きちんとした理由があるんだ。", "zh": "不，好像是有点误会……\n准备那套校服，是有正经理由的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "04410e0185320e6ceb9cf9e0e9d1b2aa4902c211d1fcf6492f063b5dad5021d2", "ja": "きちんとした理由？", "zh": "正当的理由？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1006_p", "source_sha256": "421055af013e41912e86ff4b75e3fdc70ae0b0092c4ccf51d109937610d1affe", "ja": "そう。まず大前提として……。\n星梨花には小学校の制服が似合うと思うんだよ。", "zh": "是的。首先，有一个大前提……我觉得星梨花很适合小学生制服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "6567c495fe231b892c3f30216b8d1ad388b16e00fbcd353e220cbfbdb823e139", "ja": "ほ、ほら！　やっぱり……。\nわたし、もう中学生なのに……ううっ。", "zh": "你、你看！果然还是……  \n我明明已经是初中生了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1008_p", "source_sha256": "11eaa4b1abe46e57a256ab609058988e7108687df656055efa78c3651b11f3a7", "ja": "い、いや、慌てないで聞いてくれ。このライブ企画は、\n小学校の新入生に見てもらうためのものなんだ。", "zh": "不、不是的，先别慌，听我说。这场演出企划，\n是为了让小学的新生们看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "e9cb8f799ab2d0b438071617f3fe5519d45614840ba04182a8a3c845d8575668", "ja": "あ、はい。それはわかったんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，好的。这一点我明白了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1010_p", "source_sha256": "66dc4deeddc0adcaca5873794bdd645859a30fdbc27f77ec1b3ade622a0274fa", "ja": "星梨花なら、新入生の子たちに、制服の似合う\n素敵なお姉さんだって思ってもらえるはずなんだよ。", "zh": "如果是星梨花的话，新生们一定会觉得她是位很适合穿校服的优秀姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "1f70261982e4dbfaaa4827fd0ce811ecaf4e53b34b33746b5e74a42e906ef552", "ja": "え……。素敵なお姉さん、ですか？\n小学校の制服なのに？", "zh": "诶……漂亮的大姐姐？\n明明穿的是小学生的校服？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c8c543767a0bad49a9e6d3699d5eebc2f0c5d9627644d2c23bbe2cd1492f603e", "ja": "うん。小学生の頃って、上級生のことが\nすごく大人に思えたりしなかったか？", "zh": "嗯。小学的时候，不是会觉得高年级的学生特别像大人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "3e55d5d9273e73a350f936d01a129463702d61cc7eb5feb5c8ecc25e0fd3a77d", "ja": "あ……そっか。6年生の人達って、\nすごく大人に見えました！　なるほど……。", "zh": "啊……原来如此。6年级的学生们，看起来真的很像大人！原来是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "fcc9b4600b5f5a3c8fcd5fb7b11ccda08e50ea46a490d7d37de14869556647cc", "ja": "それに新入生の子達も、同じ制服の\nお姉さんの歌のほうが、喜んでくれそうですよね！", "zh": "而且，新生们应该也会更喜欢穿着同样制服的大姐姐唱的歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e34b8296ac847d4fc3683eaef0358191137046682e05581614faeccbaafb7d6b", "ja": "うん、そうなんだ！　よかった、納得してくれたな……\nみんなの素敵な思い出になれるよう、がんばろう！", "zh": "嗯，就是这样！太好了，你能理解……  \n为了成为大家美好的回忆，我们一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "c3e2507ae81abe68d3e08fcbce91c2d7ae5b4b484a61f6aa54a9df04bba4736d", "ja": "はい！　素敵なお姉さんとして！\nわたし、がんばります！", "zh": "好的！为了成为优秀的姐姐！\n我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "3fa60cd099284edb1272b7341eda39b367604eb7bdb6cfc87db34c4f13be197d", "ja": "……あ、でも歌う時はランドセルはいらないって\n思いませんか、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "……啊，不过唱歌的时候，您不觉得不用背书包吗，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0233_1018_p", "source_sha256": "779e88e34482fbde250b1e884575c86531d8b75afd1d4992f46461f86820040d", "ja": "え！？　あ、ああ……だけどランドセルもきっと、\n新入生の憧れの装備だから。つけていこう！　な！", "zh": "诶！？啊、啊啊……不过双肩包肯定也是新生憧憬的装备。就背着去吧！对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
